# The public registry, named explicitly.
#
# Not the default-by-omission: without this, whatever registry the machine is configured
# for wins, and a corporate proxy will happily resolve every dependency through itself and
# write its own hosts into package-lock.json. That is how the lockfiles in this repo came
# to point at an internal Azure feed with sha1 integrity hashes rewritten by the proxy —
# unusable by anybody outside that network, which is everybody.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
